ap", "name_zh": "米拉娜·跳跃", "name_en": "Leap", "description_zh": "米拉娜的坐骑向前跳跃加入战斗，发出一声凶狠的咆哮鼓舞它的主人，提升攻击和移动速度。速度加成持续%leap_bonus_duration%秒。", "description_en": "Mirana leaps forward into battle, empowering herself with a ferocious roar that grants bonus attack and movement speed. Speed bonus lasts %leap_bonus_duration% seconds.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "获得+%additional_charges%跳跃能量点数。", "en": "Grants +%additional_charges% Leap charge."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["leap_distance", "leap_speed", "leap_acceleration", "leap_speedbonus", "leap_speedbonus_as", "leap_bonus_duration", "additional_charges", "AbilityCharges", "AbilityChargeRestoreTime", "AbilityManaCost"]}, {"subject": "morphling_waveform", "name_zh": "变体精灵·波浪形态", "name_en": "Waveform", "description_zh": "变体精灵化为波浪向前涌进，对路径上的敌人造成伤害。变体精灵在波浪形态中是无敌的。", "description_en": "Morphling dissolves into liquid and surges forward, damaging enemy units in his path. Morphling is invulnerable during Waveform.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["speed", "width", "process_procs", "AbilityDamage", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "morphling_replicate", "name_zh": "变体精灵·变形", "name_en": "Morph", "description_zh": "使自身向敌方目标改变，获得其基础技能，并且基于目标改变自己的主属性。技能持续时间内可以来回切换。", "description_en": "Morphling changes his form to match the targeted enemy, gaining their basic abilities and changing his primary attribute based on his target. Can be toggled for the duration of the ability.", "notes_zh": ["变体精灵自身及其控制的单位不能作为变形的目标。", "变形不会复制魔晶/神杖类技能，除非变体精灵自身也拥有相应物品。", "不会触发法术反弹。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "变形增加多样施法（右键点击技能栏图标）。开启后会产生目标英雄的强幻象，可以施放英雄的所有基础技能。如果变体精灵切换变形时幻象还存活，他就会摧毁该幻象，并取而代之。", "en": "Adds an alt-cast to Morph. When enabled, a strong illusion is created of the target hero that can cast all of the hero's basic abilities. If the illusion is alive when Morphling toggles the ability, he will take the place of the illusion, destroying it."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "scepter_stat_steal", "scepter_spell_amplify", "scepter_attack_speed", "scepter_status_resist", "scepter_additional_stats", "scepter_illusion_outgoing", "scepter_illusion_incoming", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "phantom_lancer_doppelwalk", "name_zh": "幻影长矛手·神行百变", "name_en": "Doppelganger", "description_zh": "幻影长矛手暂时从战场上消失。经过%delay%秒，幻影长矛手和附近的所有幻象都会出现在目标地点的随机位置，并产生两个新的幻象。施放技能后延长所有幻象的持续时间。新加的两个幻象拥有不同的特性：一个承受正常百分比的伤害，不具有攻击力，另一个额外承受%illusion_2_damage_in_pct%%%伤害，继承的攻击力相比本体减少%illusion_2_damage_out_pct%%%。\n\n驱散类型：弱驱散", "description_en": "Phantom Lancer briefly vanishes from the battlefield. After %delay% second, Phantom Lancer and any of his nearby illusions reappear at a random position within the targeted location, along with two additional doppelgangers. Extends duration of all illusions. The two added doppelgangers have different properties: one takes normal damage and deals none, while the other takes %illusion_2_damage_in_pct%%% bonus damage and deals %illusion_2_damage_out_pct%%% less damage.\n\nDISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_zh": ["这个技能可以躲避攻击和技能弹道，并且驱散负面效果。", "重新现身的单位附近的树木将会被摧毁。", "幻影长矛手和他的队友可以分辨出哪个幻象承受100%伤害。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["illusion_1_damage_out_pct", "illusion_2_damage_out_pct", "illusion_2_damage_in_pct", "target_aoe", "search_radius", "delay", "illusion_duration", "illusion_extended_duration", "illusion_2_amount", "hp_missing_per_extra_illusion_pct", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "phantom_lancer_phantom_edge", "name_zh": "幻影长矛手·幻影冲锋", "name_en": "Phantom Rush", "description_zh": "对目标发动攻击后，幻影长矛手将快速向其冲去，获得移动速度和闪避提升。", "description_en": "When targeting an enemy for an attack, Phantom Lancer quickly charges into range, gaining increased movement speed a